// MessagePack - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# MessagePack of {"greeting": "Hello World!"}.
# fixmap is 0x80|1, fixstr is 0xA0|len, and the key comes before the value.
0000  81 A8 67 72 65 65 74 69 6E 67 AC 48 65 6C 6C 6F |..greeting.Hello|
0010  20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21                            | World!|
